## 3. What This Proof Demonstrates

This proof pressure-combines existing lineage/provenance concepts into one local deterministic scenario table.

It demonstrates that these can influence review, warning, ranking, or blocking:

* trace ancestry
* AcceptedEvidence ancestry
* cross-domain bridge traversal
* quarantine proximity
* deadend proximity
* conflicting provenance
* supersession review pressure
* audit hash-chain continuity
* high reuse lineage / popularity
* composite lineage pressure

But none of these becomes truth, authority, direct reuse permission, action permission, DRS write authority, or Root Final authority.

Core invariant audited:

```text
lineage informs
lineage does not decide
provenance does not become truth
audit/hash-chain proves continuity, not truth
accepted evidence ancestry is not future action permission
bridge traversal is not authority transfer
quarantine/deadend proximity is bounded
ConflictCheck remains advisory
GT remains advisory
Root remains final authority
```

## 4. Scenario Coverage

